# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# coat.sm -- A box with a black band on the outside of its front wall
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# The base is clear all over, inside; the band on the outside of the
# front wall runs 10 to 20 mm up, and the outside of the bends is black.
# Seen along y, the band's rectangle meets the back wall too: at and
# depth hold it to the front wall.
sheet 1 1 0.44
plate base 0 0 100 60 at 0 0 0 axes +x +y
flange front base -y 90 30
flange back base +y 90 30
flange left base -x 90 30 span 5 55
coat clear near all
coat black far 0 10 100 20 along y from -1 to 0
coat black far edges flat 0 -2.5 100 0
coat black far edges flat 0 60 100 62.5
